<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia gold production up 16.6 pct in Jan-Nov.</title>
<headline>Mongolia gold production up 16.6 pct in Jan-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolian gold production reached 4,642.2 kg in January to November, up 16.6 percent from 3,979.8 kg in the same period last year, the State Statistical Bulletin showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bulletin gave no further details.</p>
</text>
